WEBVTT

00:26.080 --> 00:26.960
General

00:27.040 --> 00:28.440
General

00:28.680 --> 00:30.080
General

00:30.840 --> 00:32.240
Bury him

00:33.360 --> 00:34.120
General

00:34.200 --> 00:35.600
