01:12.360 --> 01:13.760
Then

01:13.920 --> 01:14.760
Spread it to

01:14.840 --> 01:16.240
Wuyang

01:16.960 --> 01:17.880
Good dog

01:17.960 --> 01:19.360
Good dog

01:19.440 --> 01:20.760
You'll be rewarded

01:20.840 --> 01:21.520
Thank you, General

01:21.600 --> 01:22.240
Thank you, General

01:22.320 --> 01:23.520
Do as he says

01:23.600 --> 01:24.360
